  "2026-10-31T12:26:57.188Z",codex-agent,"ABA function-only revert proof: withWriteHistoryFence (publication-fence). In a disposable source copy, revert only this function to c0900da; for the newly introduced helpers, use a signature-preserving no-fence adapter. The corresponding real native peer-write regression fails with Missing expected rejection, never a compile or setup failure. Control exit 1. The original transition hook/ABA property remains byte-identical. Restore fixed functions after each control; final disposable source rerun passes all 5/5 regression families. No target worktree source or tracker history is reverted."
  "2026-10-31T12:26:58.319Z",codex-agent,"ABA function-only revert proof: certifyLoopWrite (write-witness). In a disposable source copy, revert only this function to c0900da; for the newly introduced helpers, use a signature-preserving no-fence adapter. The corresponding real native peer-write regression fails with Missing expected rejection, never a compile or setup failure. Control exit 1. The original transition hook/ABA property remains byte-identical. Restore fixed functions after each control; final disposable source rerun passes all 5/5 regression families. No target worktree source or tracker history is reverted."
  "2026-10-31T12:27:48.563Z",codex-agent,"Implementation receipts: the unchanged original transition property passes all 10 hook/ABA combinations. Five ABA regression families pass (transition, process/meta reservation, fixed declaration/result, sequential checkpoint, and loop receipt). A separate positive test allows nested own writes and native no-ops while refusing a subsequent peer ABA; the existing producer-envelope contract also passes. npm run check passes with zero clones across 58 sources; explicit lint passes; docstrings cover 501 declarations. The requested seven-file run is in progress with two workers; only the previously timed-out exhaustive sequential snapshot matrix is deferred to CI, with the focused endpoint variant and all transaction hooks retained locally."
  "2026-10-31T12:51:29.236Z",codex-agent,"Observer isolation revert proof: replace only publicationWrites.exit around the onTransition callback with the previous direct callback call, retaining the new fence everywhere else. The same-client helper-write ABA regression then fails with Missing expected rejection. Restoring observer isolation passes; callbacks cannot relabel their own ordinary-peer writes as the transaction target revision."
  "2026-10-31T12:51:30.835Z",codex-agent,"Process refusal compatibility revert proof: revert only commitRetainingProcessState to c0900da. The unchanged executor/publication final-snapshot-gap regression fails its superseded predicate because the new history fence propagates loop_write_conflict directly. Restoring the domain mapping passes the complete process-publication file 14/14. This control is a typed-code mismatch, not a missing-rejection claim; peer state remains retained in both cases."
  "2026-10-31T12:51:32.437Z",codex-agent,"Reservation-specific revert proof: revert only createVerifiedItem to its c0900da envelope-only postcondition. The new process/meta reservation publication ABA regression fails with Missing expected rejection at the post-apply boundary. Fixed source passes all eight post-create hook cases across both domains. The matching-peer adoption regressions remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-31T12:51:34.440Z",codex-agent,"Final causal proof checkpoint: all 12 disposable function/adapter controls fail behaviorally on the final implementation (11 missing-rejection controls and one typed process-code mismatch). Restoration passes the seven-test ABA/positive corpus. Original transition property remains byte-identical, with all 10 hook/ABA cases passing. A fresh sequential endpoint comparison passes on c0900da, exposed a check-after-lease-release window in the initial patch, and now passes unchanged after placing the final certificate inside the source leases. The initial broad seven-file run was 324/327; its three failures have passing targeted reruns. A final seven-file run is underway with the same single exhaustive-matrix deferral."
  "2026-10-31T13:24:54.018Z",codex-agent,"Nested recovery revert proof: replace only withWriteHistoryFence with its merge-on-success implementation from 08d1a2b. The new child-refusal/body-matching recovery test fails with Missing expected rejection: the caught child conflict previously lost its witness. Shared nested witness storage restores the required refusal and preserves exact peer item/history bytes."
  "2026-10-31T13:24:55.223Z",codex-agent,"Adopted process reservation revert proof: revert only reserveProcessJob to c0900da, retaining the shared fence elsewhere. The new pre-existing matching reservation/post-adoption ABA regression fails with Missing expected rejection at the committing hook. Fixed inspection validates an SDK historical snapshot and pins that accepted revision through commit; stable subsequent retry converges without rewriting the peer."
  "2026-10-31T13:24:56.548Z",codex-agent,"Adopted meta reservation revert proof: revert only reserveMeta to c0900da. The same adoption regression passes its process case and fails the meta case with Missing expected rejection. Matching peers still adopt; once accepted in this call, a later peer ABA cannot refresh the saved revision. The temporary-approval-read retryability fix from the orchestrator is preserved."
  "2026-10-31T13:24:57.619Z",codex-agent,"Applied revision helper revert proof: replace only certifyAppliedRevision with a signature-preserving no-certificate adapter. The adopted-reservation regression fails with Missing expected rejection. Fixed source also refuses attempts to refresh a pinned snapshot from a newer SDK revision after body restoration, while allowing stable reads outside publication and normal nested own writes."
  "2026-10-31T13:24:58.708Z",codex-agent,"Updated proof and gate checkpoint: 16 final-source disposable controls pass their negative criteria (15 missing-rejection failures, one superseded-code compatibility mismatch). Restored source passes 10/10 regression families. The broad seven-file run passed 327/327, with the exhaustive snapshot matrix deferred and all original transition cases retained. The final nested/adoption extension additionally passed 9/9 selected nodes, including matching late peers and their conflicting pairs; affected process, publication, meta and transaction files are being rerun. Previous 08d1a2b packed acceptance was 6/6, but a fresh archive will be captured for the final extension before push."
